msgid ""
"To use this syntax, make sure the [`pipe-operators` experimental feature](../"
"development/experimental-features.md#xp-feature-pipe-operators) is enabled. "
"For example, include the following in [`nix.conf`](../command-ref/conf-file."
"md):"
msgstr ""
